6.0 Criteria for issuing a site alteration permit
The General Manager shall review all Applications and shall Issue a Site Alteration Permit if the General Manager is satisfied that:
(a) the person has submitted a complete Application;
(b) the site which is subject to the Application for a permit is not located within an Environmentally Sensitive Area;
(c) all work performed shall be done in accordance with the Guidelines and proper engineering practice;
(d) the Site Alteration will likely not result in:
