16.0 Application of other laws
The issuance of a Site Alteration Permit by the General Manager does not relieve the applicant of the responsibility of obtaining and complying with all other approvals that may be required by the City, or any other level of government or agencies thereof.
17.0 Schedules
All Schedules to this bylaw form a part of this bylaw.
18.0 Repeal
Bylaw 93-39 is hereby repealed.
